      139.15,
      257.59,
      451.18,
      295.46
    ],
    "text": "Clause 2 : This clause amends section 2 of the Value Added Tax Act, No. 14 of 2002(hereinafter referred to as the \u201cprincipal enactment\u201d), and the legal effect of that section asamended is to increase the VAT rate from 15% to 18% per centum on the value of goodsor services supplied, or goods imported.",
    "fonts": [
      "Times",
      "Times,Italic"
    ],
    "sizes": [
      8.0
    ]
  },
  {
    "page_number": 1,
    "bbox": [
      139.15,
      305.59,
      451.2,
      343.46
    ],
    "text": "Clause 3 : This clause amends section 10 of the principal enactment and the legal effectof that section as amended is to decrease the threshold of registration for VAT fromrupees eighty (80) million to rupees sixty (60) million per annum with effect fromJanuary 1, 2024.",
